2 PAGE Shows the filed marriage declaration of Marie Ibe Erna and Gardener Heinrich. from the Niederschönhausen registry office, where the marriage was recorded in 1935 (from Berlin State Archives).
2 DATA
3 TEXT Page 1: Marriage Details
4 CONT Source:
4 CONT 
4 CONT Top Right Blue Stamp (Death Declaration):
4 CONT 
4 CONT The husband has been declared dead.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Time of death: December 31, 1945.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Legally binding decision of the Schöneberg local court in Berlin-Schöneberg dated December 13, 1960.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Berlin, August 6, 1965. Head of the civil registry.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Registry Header:
4 CONT 
4 CONT B. No. 234 (Banns register No. 201).
4 CONT 
4 CONT Berlin-Niederschönhausen on the twenty-seventh of November, one thousand nine hundred and thirty-five (November 27, 1935).
4 CONT 
4 CONT Before the undersigned civil registrar appeared today for the purpose of marriage:
4 CONT 
4 CONT The Groom (1):
4 CONT 
4 CONT The gardener Heinrich Ludwig Richard Lieber.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Identity recognized through the banns proceedings.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Born on the fourteenth of October, one thousand eight hundred and ninety-nine (October 14, 1899) in Trendelburg, Hofgeismar district.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Birth register No. 27 of the civil registry in Trendelburg.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser Wilhelm Strasse 47.
4 CONT 
4 CONT The Bride (2):
4 CONT 
4 CONT Maria Emilie Erna Ibe, without profession.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Identity recognized through the banns proceedings.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Born on the sixth of June, one thousand nine hundred (June 6, 1900) in Cassel.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Birth register No. 1114 of the civil registry in Cassel I.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser Wilhelm Strasse 47.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Page 2: Witnesses, Signatures, and Children
4 CONT Source:
4 CONT 
4 CONT Witnesses:
4 CONT 
4 CONT As witnesses were called in and appeared:
4 CONT 
4 CONT 3. The gardener Richard Scherfling.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Identity recognized by identity card.
4 CONT 
4 CONT 28 years old, residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Kaiser-Wilhelm-Str. 67.
4 CONT 
4 CONT 4. The gardener Hugo Krüger.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Identity recognized by identity card.
4 CONT 
4 CONT 44 years old, residing in Berlin-Niederschönhausen, Eichenring 2.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Marriage Declaration (Printed Text):
4 CONT 
4 CONT The civil registrar asked the betrothed individually and one after the other the question: whether they wish to enter into marriage with each other.
4 CONT 
4 CONT The betrothed answered this question in the affirmative, and the civil registrar then pronounced that by virtue of the Civil Code they are now legally joined spouses.
4 CONT 
4 CONT Signatures:
4 CONT 
4 CONT Read aloud, approved, and signed:
4 CONT 
4 CONT Heinrich Lieber
4 CONT 
4 CONT Erna Lieber née Ibe
4 CONT 
4 CONT Richard Scherfling
4 CONT 
4 CONT Hugo Krüger
4 CONT 
4 CONT The civil registrar. (Signature/Stamp)
4 CONT 
4 CONT Bottom Left Margin Notes (Children):
4 CONT 
4 CONT A daughter born. No. 1318 / 1937 Berlin-Pankow.
4 CONT 
4 CONT A son born. No. 296 / 1939 Berlin-Pankow.
